      "name": "Optional rate-limit checks",
      "description": "Skipped by default. Set runRateLimitChecks=true and use Collection Runner (not individual Send, which does not follow setNextRequest). Set maxRateLimitAttempts above configured limits. Run last. Wait 15 minutes or restart afterward.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Rate limit login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
